":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","review_id":"zOM74Y12gGe3O0jcOgmHvA","date":"2017-09-27T02:58:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9467127323150635,"text_excerpt":"What a gem! I was invited for a happy hour event and the staff/owner were very friendly and accommodating. The place has a great vibe and their craft cocktails are creative and refreshing! We had some appetizers and most were good! I didn't care for the curry fries or pizza so much, but the spinach dip and crab dip were divine. Glad to have discovered this place"},{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","review_id":"bxOhmusnCwJ3Sq1KIAgYFA","date":"2017-12-31T23:18:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9443528652191162,"text_excerpt":"Found this place courtesy of y'all- even our hotel concierge wasn't familiar with it. We got here during happy hour which was a bonus. To start we got the Art and Spin dip that comes with sliced French bread and naan. It was fantastic and full of whole baby spinach leaves. We also got a side of truffle Mac and cheese as an app and it was some of the best I've ever had. Just the right amount of truffle oil. My husband ordered the Italian sausage flat bread that had jalapeños, mozzarella and honey. It was lukewarm and kind of meh. I ordered the boudin balls (boudin made in house and changes weekly), but unfortunately our server came back and said they were out so I got the spicy coriander c..."},{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","review_id":"RD2yw9C-GmKxg8FiEOx8Tg","date":"2017-11-07T03:54:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.93975430727005,"text_excerpt":"I have come here twice for happy hour and both times were good experiences! They offer 5$ speciality cocktails and half off spreads and breads. I really enjoy the stoned lemonade and original sin speciality cocktails. For good here I have had the crab dip which is very yummy but for some reason they serve it with hard Cristina's rather than the naan that comes with the hunmus, luckily we had ordered the hummus so used the naan from that with the crab dip. The hummus hit the spot! I have also tried the whiskey chicken sandwich which did not disappoint. Portion sizes here are fairly large so perfect for splitting and still having leftovers! A great affordable place for happy hour will defin..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","photo_id":"EtBFLyC-5EDcZEmx2x8cXw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/EtBFLyC-5EDcZEmx2x8cXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8808814287185669},{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","photo_id":"OgVNOWXrQ2a3gGPoX_UJkQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/OgVNOWXrQ2a3gGPoX_UJkQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.872739851474762},{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","photo_id":"0_FMqtfGpYnFOOkcXiaulw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0_FMqtfGpYnFOOkcXiaulw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8611565828323364},{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","photo_id":"s_n2ZEynZJAtOigMXfz1eg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/s_n2ZEynZJAtOigMXfz1eg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.80501788854599},{"business_id":"Ci9fTZBlMjf3dTrwowuntQ","photo_id":"vvzJRUllstfNQVATj__slA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/vvzJRUllstfNQVATj__slA.jpg","visual_represe